Your account must accumulate at least $20 USD before an invoice can be generated.
Balances below $20 USD will automatically roll forward until the minimum threshold is reached.
What this source proves: Published guidance checked. This checks what Vast publishes. It does not test invoice generation or payment processing.What remains: Published guidance checked. This checks what Vast publishes. It does not test invoice generation or payment processing.Whole retained source and fingerprintFull recorded wording: | Invoice minimum | At least $20 USD per [published payout guidance](https://docs.vast.ai/host/payment#minimum-payout-threshold) |JSON pointer: /sections/0/textSHA-256 9e4a9ff965510e9c08f6c45c929ab5a180d882e7dfe6c14bd65b7b30cef5814c{
  "recorded_at": "2026-09-14T15:34:50.914Z",
  "method": "Unauthenticated public browser navigation and exact section DOM extraction",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "​\nMinimum Payout Threshold",
      "heading_id": "minimum-payout-threshold",
      "text": "\nYour account must accumulate at least $20 USD before an invoice can be generated.\nBalances below $20 USD will automatically roll forward until the minimum threshold is reached.\n",
      "text_sha256": "5dc2c0de7ca0ce1530425e35cbc703d11a38e75ccd8da6ea81d58e15118b988e"
    },
    {
      "heading": "​\nInvoice Generation",
      "heading_id": "invoice-generation",
      "text": "\nInvoices are generated weekly on Fridays.\nTo generate an invoice:\n\nYou must have a valid payout method connected to your Vast.ai account.\nYour account balance must meet the $20 minimum payout threshold.\n\n",
      "text_sha256": "8dc5d6988a950d51d2752e86f08d35bf4e117de6a24890da8d1f9e3d6a976a4e"
    },
    {
      "heading": "​\nPayment Timeline",
      "heading_id": "payment-timeline",
      "text": "\nIt typically takes up to two weeks to receive your first payout.\nExample:\n\nWeek 1: Earnings accrue.\nFriday: Invoice is generated and marked as Pending.\nWeek 2 Friday: Payment is submitted to your selected payout provider.\nFunds are then processed by Wise, PayPal, or Stripe and may take additional time to appear in your account depending on the provider and your region.\n\n",
      "text_sha256": "9a26a4ca37d5525b6ff36a73accd96b600e2d47c55af820fae1c1e0faea16efb"
    },
    {
      "heading": "​\nWhen will I get paid?",
      "heading_id": "when-will-i-get-paid",
      "text": "\nIt typically takes up to two weeks to receive your first payout.\nInvoices are generated weekly on Fridays. Once an invoice is generated, it enters a pending state and is scheduled for payment during the following Friday payout cycle.\nAfter the payout is submitted, your payout provider may require additional processing time before funds appear in your account.\n",
      "text_sha256": "c1f746679d3f588c804c490e2eedc1163768fe5ac77e2d069dc0b43f96488f9a"
    },
    {
      "heading": "​\nMy account is not generating invoices.",
      "heading_id": "my-account-is-not-generating-invoices",
      "text": "\nInvoices are only generated when:\n\nA payout method is connected to your Vast.ai account.\nYour balance has reached the $20 minimum payout threshold.\n\nIf either requirement is not met, an invoice will not be generated.\nPlease verify that your payout method has been connected correctly in your account settings.\n",
      "text_sha256": "c3bfddd1848f1a850eb6122d388a99450074be74e415592b25ae59691d704dc1"
    }
  ],
  "suggest_edits": "https://github.com/vast-ai/docs/edit/main/host/payment.mdx",
  "title": "Host Payouts - Vast.ai Documentation: Affordable GPU Cloud Marketplace",
  "url": "https://docs.vast.ai/host/payment",
  "limitations": "This records current published Vast guidance from the same docs repository. It is not independent backend scheduling, account enforcement, actual payment, or owner approval evidence. The deployed Git revision is not identified by the page."
}

